{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"snoopy-humorous-doe","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_review_kernel.py:dense story and bug commentary throughout` — Preserve four-pass kernel contracts. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_reviewbot_bedrock_cutover.py:1-22, 96-117, 141-152` — Preserve provider cutover wiring. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_reviewbot_ensure_tickets.py:1-20, 216-222` — Preserve ticket-store provisioning behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_reviewed_tree_binding_heldout_da31.py:1-16` — Preserve fetched-tree and voted-revision binding. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp01_s2_bounded_op_happy.py:1-16` — Preserve bounded-operation happy path. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp01_s2_bounded_op_oracle.py:1-21 and AC docstrings` — Preserve held-out edge contracts. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp01_s3_contract_oracle.py:1-23` — Preserve usage, failure, and artifact compatibility. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp01_s3_exhaustion_happy.py:1-18` — Preserve typed-exhaustion happy path. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp01_s5_authoritative_oracle.py:1-21 and implementation-process prose throughout` — Preserve authoritative structured path. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp04_s3_dig_removal.py:1-11` — Preserve explicit-project requirement. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp04_s4_llm_runtime_heldout.py:1-9` — Preserve conflicting-carrier and secret behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp04_s4_llm_runtime.py:1-19` — Preserve native authentication injection. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp04_s6_opcert_startup_heldout.py:1-14` — Preserve startup source validation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_rp04_s6_opcert_startup.py:1-18` — Preserve startup signer composition. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_ruff_ratchet.py:1-20, 143-200` — Preserve Ruff ratchet configuration. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_run_correlation.py:1-8` — Preserve per-run trace identity. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_run_request_builder.py:1-13` — Preserve shared request construction. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_run_span.py:1-12` — Preserve one root span per gate run. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_review_kernel.py tests/unit/test_reviewbot_bedrock_cutover.py tests/unit/test_reviewbot_ensure_tickets.py tests/unit/test_reviewed_tree_binding_heldout_da31.py tests/unit/test_rp01_s2_bounded_op_happy.py tests/unit/test_rp01_s2_bounded_op_oracle.py tests/unit/test_rp01_s3_contract_oracle.py tests/unit/test_rp01_s3_exhaustion_happy.py tests/unit/test_rp01_s5_authoritative_oracle.py tests/unit/test_rp04_s3_dig_removal.py tests/unit/test_rp04_s4_llm_runtime_heldout.py tests/unit/test_rp04_s4_llm_runtime.py tests/unit/test_rp04_s6_opcert_startup_heldout.py tests/unit/test_rp04_s6_opcert_startup.py tests/unit/test_ruff_ratchet.py tests/unit/test_run_correlation.py tests/unit/test_run_request_builder.py tests/unit/test_run_span.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"de77-7c36-9e2c-453f","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit — cohort 24: review_kernel–run_span"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571681711720539,"uuid":"828ae014-fff8-4d10-85f8-acb61b60f527"}